# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
An artistic illustration for the tea page "Yue Guang Bai (Moonlight White)": a misty Yunnan mountain tea garden at night under a pale full moon, old broad-leaf tea trees in silhouette; close foreground showing two-toned dry tea leaves, one face dark and one face silvery with downy hair; a translucent porcelain cup nearby holding warm golden-amber liquor; wet-on-wet ink wash textures, restrained silver and indigo accents, soft paper grain; no text, no characters, no logos; premium, calm, museum-poster feel, high quality digital art.
